  "name": "Spiced Chocolate Cake",
  "subtitle": "A layered chocolate cake with warm holiday spices and vanilla buttercream",
  "description": "A rich chocolate cake flavored with ginger, cinnamon, and nutmeg, finished with a smooth spiced buttercream.",
